  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards use the engine-owned champion resolver on each existing 64x64 ImageRunner, retaining the stock card's scrolling, clipping and local layer; raw texture-source mutation, spawned overlays and render-hook sprites are disabled, and the native icon is always visible on failure. Battle, BP and compact portrait cameras are unchanged. Yone's reference-grounded native eight-frame run action now uses eight intact authored run frames with one proportional fit per frame: no leg split, frame blend, body shear, synthetic sword redraw or alpha afterimage. The canonical frames face screen-right and rely only on the game's native flip_x when movement changes side. Fate Sealed keeps its staged wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo presentation aligned to the real rush tick. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required only for the previously introduced current Yone action tree.",
